SetAssetConfig_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when caller not owner
│  └── it should revert
└── when caller owner
   ├── when asset zero
   │  └── it should revert with ZeroAsset
   ├── when feed zero
   │  ├── given prior entry
   │  │  ├── it should clear the entry
   │  │  └── it should emit AssetConfigSet with zero feed
   │  └── given no prior entry
   │     └── it should be a no-op emit
   └── when feed non zero
      ├── when heartbeat zero
      │  └── it should revert with ZeroHeartbeat
      ├── when asset decimals exceed cap
      │  └── it should revert with DecimalsTooHigh
      └── when valid
         ├── it should cache asset and feed decimals
         ├── it should store feed and heartbeat
         └── it should emit AssetConfigSet
